  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {合意|ごうい}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{達|たっ}する→達する：02129_tassuru⟧ (to reach an agreement)\n- {合意|ごうい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{得|え}る→得る：02014_eru⟧ (to obtain agreement)\n- {合意|ごうい}⟦{形成|けいせい}→形成：12541_keisei⟧ (consensus building)\n- {合意|ごうい}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{上|うえ}→上：00682_ue⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧ (by mutual consent)\n\nUSAGE:\n- {合意|ごうい} emphasizes mutual agreement between parties.\n- Often used in business, legal, and diplomatic contexts.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{同意|どうい}→同意：05092_doui⟧ - agreement (can be one-sided)\n- ⟦{協定|きょうてい}→協定：05320_kyoutei⟧ - accord, pact",
